      "short": "No, she should only have to pay \\$423.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Total before discount} &= \\$285+\\$165\\\\&=\\$450\\\\\\text{Discounted total} &=0.94\\times\\$450\\\\&=\\$423\\end{align*}$$\nNo. The correct bill is \\$423, so \\$425 is \\$2 too much.",
